# Nova Pentacle in a game of three (CR 602.3a: "if there is more than one opponent who could make such a choice, the
# ability's controller decides which of those opponents will make the choice"; the ruling "in multi-player games you can
# choose a different opposing player each time it is used"). On turn 4 Bot2 casts Lightning Bolt at Bot1, who responds with
# the Pentacle: Bot1 is offered only its opponents - not itself - and picks Bot3, and Bot3 targets Bot1's own Sanctuary Cat
# (1/2). As the ability resolves Bot1 chooses the Bolt on the stack as the source (CR 609.7a): its 3 damage to Bot1 is dealt
# to the Cat instead, which dies, and Bot1 stays at 20.

[Bot1 Deck]
Nova Pentacle
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl x3
Sanctuary Cat
Plains
Plains x25

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Island x25

[Bot3 Deck]
Island x30

